# Web Design 1 - Assignment 1

##  Project Overview

This project is a simple introductory web page created using HTML. It is part of the Web Design 1 course assignment at Limkokwing University of Creative Technology.

The purpose of this project is to demonstrate basic knowledge of HTML structure and the ability to create and publish a simple webpage using GitHub.

---

##  Objectives

* Create a GitHub account
* Join the class repository
* Develop a simple HTML webpage
* Upload and manage files on GitHub

---

##  Page Structure

The webpage includes the following sections:

* Header
* Full Name
* Program
* Short Bio
* Why I Study Web Design (5 reasons)
* Career Goals (5 points)
* Footer

